#: ../../source/features/multi-engine.rst:357
msgid "Example deployment label configuration for TRT-LLM:"
msgstr "TRT-LLM 的 deployment 标签配置示例："

#: ../../source/features/multi-engine.rst:367
msgid "TRT-LLM Limitations"
msgstr "TRT-LLM 限制"

#: ../../source/features/multi-engine.rst:369
msgid ""
"**No queue-depth metrics**: TRT-LLM does not expose "
"``num_requests_running`` or ``num_requests_waiting``. Routing policies "
"that rely on queue depth (e.g., least-request) will fall back to random "
"routing."
msgstr ""
"**无队列深度指标** ：TRT-LLM 不暴露 ``num_requests_running`` 或 "
"``num_requests_waiting`` 。依赖队列深度的路由策略（例如 least-request）会回退到随机路由。"

#: ../../source/features/multi-engine.rst:370
msgid ""
"**Metrics require explicit config**: Performance metrics are only emitted"
" when ``return_perf_metrics: true``, ``enable_iter_perf_stats: true``, "
"and ``enable_iter_req_stats: true`` are set in the TRT-LLM server "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"**指标需要显式配置** ：仅当 TRT-LLM server 配置中设置 ``return_perf_metrics: true`` "
"、``enable_iter_perf_stats: true`` 和 ``enable_iter_req_stats: true`` "
"时才会发出性能指标。"

#: ../../source/features/multi-engine.rst:373
msgid "SGLang Decisions API"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/features/multi-engine.rst:375
msgid ""
"SGLang serves ``POST /v1/decisions``, which answers typed ``choice``, "
"``score`` and ``yes_no`` questions about an input by scoring answer "
"labels, without generating text. The gateway routes it to the pods of the"
" requested model, like the other model endpoints:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/features/multi-engine.rst:395
#: ../../source/features/multi-engine.rst:482
msgid "What differs from the other endpoints:"
msgstr "与其他端点的不同之处："

#: ../../source/features/multi-engine.rst:397
msgid ""
"``model`` is required. SGLang treats it as optional and echoes a default,"
" but the gateway needs it to select a pod, so a request without one is "
"rejected with ``400``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/features/multi-engine.rst:399
msgid ""
"``input`` is required and may be a string, an object or an array. The "
"gateway uses it, with objects and arrays compacted to JSON text, as the "
"routing text for prefix-cache-aware routing. ``questions`` must be a non-"
"empty array. The question schema itself is validated by SGLang."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/features/multi-engine.rst:402
msgid ""
"There is no streaming and no generation. Usage reports ``prompt_tokens`` "
"and ``total_tokens`` only, with ``completion_tokens`` at ``0``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/features/multi-engine.rst:404
msgid ""
"``images`` are forwarded as sent. The gateway buffers the whole request "
"body, so large base64 images count against the ``bufferLimit`` of the "
"gateway's ``ClientTrafficPolicy`` (4 MiB by default). Raise it, together "
"with ``AIBRIX_GRPC_MAX_MESSAGE_SIZE_BYTES``, if you send big images."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/features/multi-engine.rst:408
msgid ""
"The gateway does not check the engine, so a decisions request for a model"
" served by another engine is forwarded and fails at the pod. Only route "
"it to ``model.aibrix.ai/engine: sglang`` models."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/features/multi-engine.rst:412
msgid "SGLang System One API"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/features/multi-engine.rst:414
msgid ""
"SGLang's ``POST /v1/systemone`` serves the same decisions in the System "
"One request shape: a ``state`` and a map of ``noul``, ``choice`` and "
"``score`` questions keyed by your own ids. The gateway routes it to the "
"pods of the requested model, like ``/v1/decisions``:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/features/multi-engine.rst:436
msgid "What differs from ``/v1/decisions``:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/features/multi-engine.rst:438
msgid ""
"``model`` is required and must be a model the gateway serves. SGLang "
"accepts any name, but the gateway selects a pod with it, so a model that "
"is not deployed is rejected with ``400`` ``model_not_found``. A client "
"library that sends a default model name, such as the TypeSafe SDKs' "
"``jev-latest``, has to be told to send your model's name instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/features/multi-engine.rst:442
msgid ""
"``state`` is required and may be a string, an object or an array. Unlike "
"a decisions ``input`` it may be empty, because SGLang accepts an empty "
"state. The gateway uses it, with objects and arrays compacted to JSON "
"text, as the routing text for prefix-cache-aware routing: SGLang puts the"
" state at the head of every question's prompt, so it is the part the "
"questions share. A pod serving a decision checkpoint renders an object "
"state with spaces after the JSON separators, so the routing text then "
"differs from the prompt by whitespace; this only affects the cache-"
"affinity estimate."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/features/multi-engine.rst:448
msgid ""
"``questions`` must be a non-empty object keyed by your ids. An array, the"
" ``/v1/decisions`` shape, is rejected with ``400``. The question schema "
"itself is validated by SGLang."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/features/multi-engine.rst:450
msgid ""
"There is no streaming and no generation. Usage reports ``input_tokens``, "
"which counts the prompt of every question, so the state is counted once "
"per question, and ``output_tokens`` at ``0``. There is no "
"``total_tokens``: the gateway counts input plus output as the total for "
"rate-limit and request metrics, and forwards the usage block unchanged."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/features/multi-engine.rst:454
msgid ""
"``images`` are forwarded as sent, with the same ``bufferLimit`` caveat as"
" for ``/v1/decisions``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/features/multi-engine.rst:455
msgid ""
"The TypeSafe SDKs time out after 10 seconds and retry. Each retry reaches"
" the gateway as a separate request, so request counts and token usage "
"include the retries."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/features/multi-engine.rst:458
msgid ""
"The same engine caveat applies: a request for a model served by another "
"engine is forwarded and fails at the pod. SGLang also serves the route "
"only for models with a Jinja chat template; its decision-models "
"documentation lists what it refuses."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/features/multi-engine.rst:463
msgid "SGLang Score API"
msgstr "SGLang Score API"

#: ../../source/features/multi-engine.rst:465
msgid ""
"SGLang serves ``POST /v1/score``, which scores items against a query "
"without generating text: label-token probabilities for a causal LM, or "
"class logits for a sequence-classification model. The gateway routes it "
"to the pods of the requested model, like the other model endpoints:"
msgstr ""
"SGLang 提供 ``POST /v1/score`` ，在不生成文本的情况下针对查询为各条目打分：因果语言模型返回标签 token "
"的概率，序列分类模型返回类别 logits。网关会像其他模型端点一样，将其路由到所请求模型的 Pod："

#: ../../source/features/multi-engine.rst:484
msgid ""
"``model`` is required. SGLang falls back to a default model, but the "
"gateway needs the name to select a pod, so a request without one is "
"rejected with ``400``."
msgstr "``model`` 为必填项。SGLang 会回退到默认模型，但网关需要模型名来选择 Pod，因此缺少该字段的请求会以 ``400`` 被拒绝。"

#: ../../source/features/multi-engine.rst:486
msgid ""
"``items`` is required and cannot be empty. It may be a string, an array "
"of strings or an array of token-ID arrays. ``query`` is optional and "
"takes text or token IDs."
msgstr ""
"``items`` 为必填项且不能为空，可以是字符串、字符串数组或 token ID 数组的数组。 ``query`` 为可选项，可以是文本或 "
"token ID。"

#: ../../source/features/multi-engine.rst:488
msgid ""
"Every other field, such as ``label_token_ids``, ``apply_softmax``, "
"``item_first`` and the setwise ``score_extraction_token``, is forwarded "
"as sent and validated by SGLang."
msgstr ""
"其他字段，例如 ``label_token_ids`` 、 ``apply_softmax`` 、 ``item_first`` 以及 "
"setwise 模式的 ``score_extraction_token`` ，都会原样转发，由 SGLang 校验。"

#: ../../source/features/multi-engine.rst:490
msgid ""
"The routing text for prefix-cache-aware routing is the ``query`` when it "
"is text, otherwise the first item when the items are text. Token-ID input"
" gives no routing text."
msgstr ""
"前缀缓存感知路由使用的路由文本：当 ``query`` 为文本时使用 ``query`` ，否则在条目为文本时使用第一个条目。token ID "
"形式的输入不产生路由文本。"

#: ../../source/features/multi-engine.rst:492
msgid ""
"There is no streaming, and ``stream: true`` is rejected with ``400``. The"
" response, including nested setwise ``scores`` and "
"``pooled_hidden_states``, is forwarded unchanged. Usage is counted when "
"SGLang reports it."
msgstr ""
"不支持流式， ``stream: true`` 会以 ``400`` 被拒绝。响应（包括 setwise 模式下嵌套的 ``scores`` 和 "
"``pooled_hidden_states`` ）会原样转发。SGLang 报告 usage 时会计入用量。"

#: ../../source/features/multi-engine.rst:496
msgid ""
"The gateway does not check the engine, so a score request for a model "
"served by another engine is forwarded and fails at the pod. Only route it"
" to ``model.aibrix.ai/engine: sglang`` models."
msgstr ""
"网关不检查引擎，因此发往其他引擎所服务模型的 score 请求会被转发，并在 Pod 上失败。请仅将其路由到 "
"``model.aibrix.ai/engine: sglang`` 的模型。"

